/**
 * Meta (Facebook + Instagram) · /solutions/platforms/meta
 *
 * What hubStudio does for Meta, across four service lanes: content, ad
 * creative, UGC and avatar. Editorial print-shop layout (crop marks,
 * calibration color bar, mono figure labels, dashed rules) carried over
 * from /services/design/video-production.
 *
 * Page excerpt (25 words): hubStudio makes four kinds of work for Meta:
 * organic content, ad creative, creator-style UGC, and brand-owned avatar
 * video for Facebook and Instagram, from one brief.
 *
 * Per repo standards: no em-dashes (U+2014), no decorative numerals inside
 * cards or repeated blocks, body copy at var(--type-body), hubStudio keeps
 * its canonical lowercase-h casing.
 */
